-- ===================================================================================================
-- PART IV.  Gov. Code ch. 6 (operation of statutes), and commencement
-- ===================================================================================================

GIVEN sess IS A `Session of enactment`
      day IS A DATE
      adj IS A MAYBE DATE
      election IS A BOOLEAN
      tax IS A BOOLEAN
      approp IS A BOOLEAN
      urgency IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Enactment of a statute`
`an enactment in` sess `on` day `adjourned` adj `with flags` election tax approp urgency MEANS
    `Enactment of a statute` WITH
        `the session` IS sess
        `the moment of enactment` IS `the moment on` day `at second` 43200
        `the special session adjourned on` IS adj
        `calls an election` IS election
        `provides for a tax levy` IS tax
        `provides for appropriations for the usual current expenses of the state` IS approp
        `is an urgency statute` IS urgency
        `names its own day of effect` IS NOTHING

