GIVEN named IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Enactment of a statute`
`an enactment naming its own day` named MEANS
    `Enactment of a statute` WITH
        `the session` IS `a regular session`
        `the moment of enactment` IS `the moment on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `at second` 43200
        `the special session adjourned on` IS NOTHING
        `calls an election` IS FALSE
        `provides for a tax levy` IS FALSE
        `provides for appropriations for the usual current expenses of the state` IS FALSE
        `is an urgency statute` IS FALSE
        `names its own day of effect` IS JUST named

GIVEN judicial IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A `Days supplied by the caller`
`the days supplied are only these section 135 judicial holidays` judicial MEANS
    `Days supplied by the caller` WITH
        `Lunar New Year days` IS EMPTY
        `Diwali days` IS EMPTY
        `days appointed by the President or Governor for a public fast, thanksgiving or holiday` IS EMPTY
        `Thursdays appointed as Thanksgiving Day` IS EMPTY
        `Good Friday days` IS EMPTY
        `days on which March 31 is observed instead` IS EMPTY
        `March 31 itself stays a holiday in a year in which it is observed on another day` IS TRUE
        `judicial holidays specified in Code Civ. Proc. section 135` IS judicial
        `days a public office is closed for the whole day` IS EMPTY
        `bank closings under the Bank Extraordinary Situation Closing Act` IS EMPTY

